oms from messaging apps like…"],"features":["One-click lesson generation — Describe a topic or attach your materials; the AI builds a full lesson in minutes","Multi-agent classroom — AI teachers and peers lecture, discuss, and interact with you in real time","Rich scene types — Slides, quizzes, interactive HTML simulations, and project-based learning (PBL)","Whiteboard & TTS — Agents draw diagrams, write formulas, and explain out loud","Export anywhere — Download editable .pptx slides or interactive .html pages"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/THU-MAIC/OpenMAIC/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"bb114860d2a4730f374e4017838b422850eb2800bf2718afc076d0a59c907df5","extractedAt":"2026-10-03T05:59:55.585Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-04T08:15:34.510Z","overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-04T08:13:41Z","previewAttemptAt":"2026-10-03T06:18:11.002Z","demoHealth":{"url":"https://open.maic.chat/","attemptedAt":"2026-10-03T14:19:35.008Z","status":"unknown","error":{"reason":"empty_page","at":"2026-10-03T14:19:35.008Z"},"nextCheckAt":"2026-10-03T20:19:35.008Z"},"projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Get an immersive, multi-agent learning experience in just one click","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/THU-MAIC/OpenMAIC/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"The copied example needs only OPENAIAPIKEY in .env.local (or change its provider to one you have a key for); its other providers and slots are commented out until you want them. openmaic.yml says which providers (accounts) the server can call and which model each slot (a use of AI: the outline, slide content, text to speech, web search, …) uses.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/THU-MAIC/OpenMAIC/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"api_key","status":"not_required","text":"No API key is required.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/THU-MAIC/OpenMAIC/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"api_key","status":"required","text":"The built-in provider supports SenseVoiceSmall, Paraf